{% comment %}
  This snippet is used to display a scarcity indicator for a product variant. It checks the availability of the selected variant and displays a message indicating whether the product is sold out, available, or how many units are left in stock. The indicator also includes an icon for visual representation.
  Total edition size can be set in the edition_size metafield on the product, or it will default to edition_fallback, or then to 5 if it's not set anywhere. The low threshold is calculated as half of the edition size.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} Check for availability and inventory quantity
  - block: {Object} The section block this indicator renders from, used only for its theme-editor attributes; omit it and the indicator becomes unselectable in the editor while the storefront is unaffected (optional)
  - edition_fallback: {Integer} Edition size to use when the product has no edition_size metafield; falls back to 5 when omitted, so the indicator still renders (optional)
  - dynamic_content: {Boolean} Whether to add aria-live="polite" to the indicator for screen readers; defaults to false (optional)

  Usage:
  {% render 'scarcityindicator', block: block, product: product, edition_fallback: block.settings.edition_size, dynamic_content: true %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign qty = variant.inventory_quantity
  assign edition = product.metafields.custom.edition_size.value | default: edition_fallback | default: 5
  assign low_threshold = edition | divided_by: 2.0

  if variant.available == false
    assign state = 'sold'
  elsif variant.inventory_management == blank
    assign state = 'ok'
  elsif qty <= 1
    assign state = 'critical'
  elsif qty <= low_threshold
    assign state = 'low'
  else
    assign state = 'ok'
  endif
-%}

<p class="scarcity scarcity--{{ state }}" {% if dynamic_content %} aria-live="polite" {% endif %} {% if block %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }} {% endif %}>
    <span class="scarcity__dot svg-wrapper" aria-hidden="true">
  {{- 'icon-inventory-status.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
</span>
    <span class="scarcity__text">
    {%- if state == 'sold' -%}
      Sold out
    {%- elsif variant.inventory_management == blank -%}
      Available
    {%- else -%}
      {{ qty }} of {{ edition }} available
    {%- endif -%}
  </span>
</p>
